  "description": "BrickStoreSharp is a .NET library for reading and writing BrickStore inventory files (*.bsx, https://github.com/rgriebl/brickstore), e.g. to manage LEGO brick inventories for BrickLink and Brick Owl.\n\nFeatures\n* Read and write BrickStore inventory files following BrickStore's BrickStoreXML schema\n* Lossless load/save: elements the library does not interpret (e.g. GuiState, DifferenceBaseValues) are written back unchanged\n* Typed access to items: type, color, condition, status, quantity, prices, tiered prices, cost, weight, stockroom, markers and more\n* Culture-independent number handling and safe saving that never destroys an existing file\n* Compatible with .NET Standard 2.0, .NET 8 and .NET 10",
  "id": "BrickStoreSharp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-28T06:20:28.013Z",
  "licenseExpression": "Apache-2.0",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/Apache-2.0",
  "listed": true,
